# Turbulent Crater: "This land enters tapped unless your opponents control eight or more lands." On turn 15 Bot2 has
# seven lands, so Bot1's Crater (its eighth land) enters tapped: one short of the threshold, and Bot1's own lands are
# not the ones counted. On turn 16 Bot1 has exactly eight lands, so Bot2's Crater enters untapped (at the threshold).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp x7
Turbulent Crater
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x7
Turbulent Crater
Mountain x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Turbulent Crater.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Turbulent Crater.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 8
Bot2.Hand.Turbulent Crater.Play
? Bot2.Battlefield.Turbulent Crater.Tapped = false

[Expect]
Turn = 16
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 8
Bot1.Battlefield.Turbulent Crater.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 8
Bot2.Battlefield.Turbulent Crater.Tapped = false
